      "body_html": "Co-owner Damon Collinsworth holding a N. x Dyeriana, an old hybrid bred back in the 1800's!  This is a lowlander hybrid:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_7992.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>Nepenthes hybrid thriving:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8102.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>This was labeled N. dubia:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8021.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>Not sure what this one is-maybe a spectabilis hybrid of some sort:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8022.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>N. inermis:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8032.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>Beautiful specimen plant of N. mikei:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8042.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>close-up shot of N. mikei:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8040.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>last shot of N. mikei:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8039.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>N. singalana:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8035.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>Another shot of N. singalana:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8031.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>N. izumiae:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8034.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>N. ramispina:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8005.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>not sure:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8041.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>N. aristolochioides:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8025.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>Another shot:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8024.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>One more:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8023.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>And last but not least, N. x Peter D'amato:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/IMG_8090.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>",
